  "title": "Boiler Preventive Maintenance Service Log",
  "subtitle": "Record authorized boiler maintenance, condition findings, measured results, corrective work, and service closeout.",
  "description": "A boiler-specific preventive maintenance record that captures completed work and evidence across fuel, combustion, venting, water, pressure, controls, safety devices, defects, and return to service.",
  "use_case": "Use for recurring or seasonal boiler service when technicians and facility owners need a defensible record of authorized scope, actual work, test evidence, exceptions, decisions, and accountable handoff.",
